### Summary of the gap
The hard 50/city rejection (`CheckCityCapacity` → `CityAtCapacityException` → 409) is fully implemented and wired into `owners.POST.yml`. The **`capacityWarning` soft-warning at 40–49 is NOT implemented anywhere** — it is only expected by `AcceptanceTest`. To satisfy it you would add a transient `capacityWarning` field to `Owner.java`, a read-only `capacityWarning` boolean to the `Owner` schema in `openapi.yml`, and a flag-setting function (modeled on `FlagBulkSignup`) wired into `owners.POST.yml`.

